# PlayerPack image, generated independently from the pack.h:33-88 field order
# (python struct.pack, no Go code involved) for the state asserted by
# TestPlayerPackGoldenImage. On-disk order is little-endian per
# Source/utils/endian_swap.hpp:27-49; reserved bytes are zero.
# offsets: name=16 InvBody=124 InvList=257 InvGrid=1017 NumInv=1057
# SpdList=1058 TownWarps=1210 Reflections=1218 SplLvl2=1222 Reserved8=1232
# DiabloKillLevel=1234 class=48 gold=55 splLvl=79 memSpells=116

